74141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508130/extras/c0fa28ad77d4c4cdd6dfeee40d926885.webm?t=1725274141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508130/extras/7c4a9b206a9558dd0e66bb8c253b7577.avif?t=1725274141\" /></span><br>WERK while you play as a young woman who has moved to a big city to pursue her dreams. However, life in the city is tough, and you quickly realize that making ends meet is no easy task. With rent, bills, and other expenses piling up, you must find a way to earn enough money to survive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508130/extras/aafdd91d6083cf47680da1ba4ef3aa69.avif?t=1725274141\" /></span><br><br>WERK resource management simulator where you have to balance your time, money, and energy to achieve your goals. You have to take on various jobs, each with its own set of challenges and rewards. You find work in places you would normally look past, on platforms that only the brave would consider, or take up a job at a club that no one talks about. The more you work, the more money you earn, which you can use to pay your bills, rent, and anything extra you may want out of life.<br><br>However, time is limited, and you need to be careful not to overwork yourself, or you'll run out of energy and won't be able to perform tasks effectively. Additionally, unexpected events and emergencies can arise, such as getting sick or dealing with a sudden financial crisis, which can impact your progress and force you to adapt to new challenges.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508130/extras/f794c04227f91548af5ef335e8fbd5b8.avif?t=1725274141\" /></span><br><br>The ultimate goal of the game is to survive and thrive in the big city. You need to make enough money to pay your rent and bills, build up your savings, and eventually achieve your dreams. But it won't be easy. You'll need to work hard, manage your resources effectively, and make tough decisions along the way.<br><br>As you progress, you can upgrade your skills and equipment, allowing you to earn more money and take on more significant challenges. You can also interact with various characters, including other struggling individuals like yourself, who can offer you advice, support, or even job opportunities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508130/extras/23ddbf100b0c8d9957e5288e5ab37539.poster.avif?t=1725274141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508130/extras/23ddbf100b0c8d9957e5288e5ab37539.webm?t=1725274141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508130/extras/d57b60f13cb15e8c4f4b8b703090bede.poster.avif?t=1725274141\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508130/extras/d57b60f13cb15e8c4f4b8b703090bede.apng?t=1725274141\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508130/extras/b74d5ae08d8661aa03918632109d14f6.poster.avif?t=1725274141\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508130/extras/b74d5ae08d8661aa03918632109d14f6.gif?t=1725274141\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset